  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n84 ÷ 32 × 8 - 15 ÷ 8 × (19 - 35)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n** [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] **\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n84 ÷ 32 × 8 - 15 ÷ 8 × (19 - 35)\n\n⇒ 84 ÷ 32 × 8 - 15 ÷ 8 × (- 16)\n\n⇒ 21/8 × 8 - (15/8) × (- 16)\n\n⇒ 21 + 30\n\n⇒ 51\n\n**∴ The required answer is 51.**",
